    {
      "kind": "crux",
      "subject": "kgosigadi ya magodimo",
      "rationale": "Mokgopo wa 'malkat hašamayim' — modimo wa selekane wa di-Assyria le Babilonia (Ištar goba Anat); ba bangwe ba re 'kgosigadi', ba bangwe 'mokgopi wa magodimo'."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Ka gobane go dira re tla dira ⟨את⟩ lentšu ka moka leo le tšwago molomo wa rena, go fiša mokgopo go kgosigadi ya magodimo le go tšela go yona dinyakwa, bjalo ka ge re dirile rena, bo-ntate ba rena, dikgoši tša rena le balaodi ba rena, didorong tša Yehuda le diterateng tša Yerushalayime; gomme re tletše bogobe, gomme re bile ba botse, gomme bobe ga ra se bone.",
